  "description": "Baek Chunho seeks to get revenge on Shin Jaehee, the man he believes raped his younger sister, by giving him a taste of his own medicine. However, when he finds out that it was all a misunderstanding, he nervously goes to Jaehee's house to apologize...\n\"Hyung, I thought about it and... I think I'm gay!\"\nFor a situation where a police report wouldn't even be enough, he wants to date me instead?\nWhat the hell is wrong with this guy...? \n\n(Source: Mr. Blue, translated)",
